@startuml Tourist_Profile_Management_SSD

actor "Tourist" as Tourist
participant "UI: Profile" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "S3 Storage" as S3

== View Profile ==

Tourist -> UI: Access profile page
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch user profile data
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return profile data\n(name, email, birthday, gender,\ncountry, language, profile picture)
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Display profile information
deactivate UI

== Update Profile Picture ==

Tourist -> UI: Click camera icon/upload photo
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Show file picker

Tourist -> UI: Select image file

UI -> UI: Show image preview

Tourist -> UI: Confirm upload

UI -> S3: Upload profile picture
activate S3
S3 --> UI: Return S3 URL
deactivate S3

UI -> DB: Update profile picture URL
activate DB
DB --> UI: Profile updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Show success, display new picture
deactivate UI

== Update Account Info ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Account settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display account form\n(first name, last name, email)

Tourist -> UI: Modify details and submit

UI -> UI: Validate input

alt Input valid
    UI -> DB: Update account information
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Account updated
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Tourist: Show success message
else Input invalid
    UI --> Tourist: Show validation errors
end

deactivate UI

== Update Birthday ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Birthday settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display birthday picker

Tourist -> UI: Select date and submit

UI -> DB: Update birthday
activate DB
DB --> UI: Birthday updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Show success message
deactivate UI

== Update Gender ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Gender settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display gender options

Tourist -> UI: Select gender and submit

UI -> DB: Update gender
activate DB
DB --> UI: Gender updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Show success message
deactivate UI

== Update Country ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Country settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display country list

Tourist -> UI: Select country and submit

UI -> DB: Update country
activate DB
DB --> UI: Country updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Tourist: Show success message
deactivate UI

== Change Language ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Language settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display language options\n(English/Filipino)

Tourist -> UI: Select language

UI -> UI: Update app language\n(save to localStorage)

UI --> Tourist: Refresh interface with new language
deactivate UI

== Access Settings ==

Tourist -> UI: Navigate to Settings
activate UI

UI --> Tourist: Display settings options\n(tutorial replay, privacy policy, etc.)

deactivate UI

== Logout ==

Tourist -> UI: Click "Logout"
activate UI

UI -> UI: Clear authentication data\n(localStorage, sessionStorage)

UI --> Tourist: Redirect to login page
deactivate UI

@enduml
